---
import { UNIVERSE } from '../config';
const payload = JSON.stringify(UNIVERSE).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f3eb" /><meta name="description" content="收藏我们的小日子，和每一个值得记住的瞬间。" /><title>{UNIVERSE.profile.siteName} · 把日子写成故事</title><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/universe.css" /></head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#memories">跳到回忆</a>
<header class="site-header wrap"><a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="回到首页"><span class="brand-mark">u<span>♡</span></span><span data-site-name>我们的宇宙<small>OUR LITTLE UNIVERSE</small></span></a><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#memories">时光手记</a><a href="#gallery">相片集</a><a href="#wishes">一起的愿望</a><a href="#assistant">回忆小助手 <span class="tiny-dot"></span></a></nav><button class="button button-outline local-only" id="open-studio"><span>＋</span> 整理我们的故事</button></header>
<main id="home">
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="short-line"></span> A LITTLE SPACE, JUST FOR US</p><h1>有你在的日子，<br />都值得<span class="hand-underlined">被记住<svg viewBox="0 0 400 25" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 14Q180-4 390 13M35 23Q210 6 360 20" /></svg></span>。</h1><p class="hero-motto" id="motto">把平凡的日子，收藏成我们的浪漫。</p><div class="couple-line"><span class="avatar">Y</span><span class="avatar avatar-two">U</span><span id="couple-names">小宇 & 小宙</span><span class="couple-dash"></span><span>故事，慢慢写</span></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#memories">翻开我们的故事 <span>↗</span></a><button class="text-button" id="open-letter">给你的一封信 <span>♡</span></button></div><p class="demo-note" id="demo-note"><span>✧</span> 现在展示的是示例故事，等你写下真正的我们</p></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="回忆插画拼贴"><div class="orbit"></div><span class="doodle doodle-star">✧</span><span class="doodle doodle-heart">♡</span><span class="tiny-script">with you, always.</span><figure class="polaroid polaroid-back"><img id="hero-back" width="300" height="370" alt="窗边时光，示例插画" /><figcaption>every little moment</figcaption></figure><figure class="polaroid polaroid-front"><div class="tape"></div><img id="hero-front" width="300" height="370" alt="海边日落，示例插画" /><figcaption>想和你，看很多次日落 ♡</figcaption></figure><span class="art-label">ILLUSTRATED MEMORIES / 示例插画</span><div class="round-stamp">MADE WITH<br /><strong>love</strong><br />JUST FOR YOU</div></div></section>
<section class="time-ribbon wrap" aria-label="我们的时光"><div class="time-title"><span class="mini-heart">♡</span><p>我们的故事<small>每一天，都算数</small></p></div><div class="day-counter"><strong id="days-together">—</strong><span id="days-label">等你写下第一天</span></div><div class="time-since" id="since-date">设置相恋日期，开启我们的计时</div><div class="next-date"><span class="eyebrow">NEXT LITTLE CELEBRATION</span><strong id="next-anniversary">下一次值得期待的日子</strong><span id="anniversary-gap">把重要的日期，放在心上</span></div></section>
<section class="chapter wrap" id="memories"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 01 / THE WAY WE WERE</p><h2>时光有迹，<em>爱有回声。</em></h2></div><p class="section-caption">不一定是盛大的瞬间，<br />也可以是那个普通的星期天。</p></div><div class="memory-toolbar"><div class="pills" id="memory-filters"><button class="pill active" data-tag="">全部手记</button></div><span class="quiet" id="memory-count"></span></div><div class="memory-list" id="memory-list"></div><div class="empty-state" id="memory-empty" hidden><span>✧</span><h3>故事的第一页，留给你们。</h3><p>记下一句想说的话，或者今天的小小开心。</p><button class="button button-outline local-only" data-studio-tab="memory">写下第一篇</button></div></section>
<section class="gallery-section" id="gallery"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 02 / THROUGH OUR LENS</p><h2>把喜欢的瞬间，<em>留在眼前。</em></h2></div><button class="text-button" id="open-game">玩一局回忆翻牌 <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="photo-grid" id="photo-grid"></div><p class="quiet gallery-note">点击照片，慢慢看。也可以收藏视频，和那天的声音。</p></div></section>
<section class="chapter wrap wishes-section" id="wishes"><div class="wish-intro"><p class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 03 / THINGS TO DO, TOGETHER</p><h2>以后，<br />还想和你<em>一起。</em></h2><p>把“有机会”写成清单，<br />再把清单，过成生活。</p><span class="wish-doodle">✻</span></div><div class="wish-paper"><div class="paper-top"><span>OUR LITTLE BUCKET LIST</span><span id="wish-count">0 / 0</span></div><div id="wish-list"></div><form id="wish-form" class="wish-add local-only"><label class="sr-only" for="new-wish">新增愿望</label><input id="new-wish" placeholder="还有一件想一起做的事……" maxlength="120" required /><button aria-label="添加愿望" type="submit">＋</button></form><p class="paper-bottom">One little wish at a time. <span>♡</span></p></div></section>
<section class="assistant-section wrap" id="assistant"><div class="assistant-star">✧</div><div class="assistant-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP REMEMBERING</p><h2>我们的小事，<em>它也记得。</em></h2><p>找一段回忆，整理一篇月刊，或者想想下一次约会。<br />从你们留下的真实记录里，寻找答案。</p><span class="model-status" id="model-status"><span class="tiny-dot"></span> 正在检查本地助手</span></div><div class="assistant-panel"><p class="assistant-greeting">今天，想重温哪段时光？</p><div class="suggestions"><button data-question="我们有哪些旅行的回忆？">找一段旅行回忆</button><button data-question="帮我整理最近的回忆，写一段回忆录草稿">整理一段回忆录</button></div><form id="ask-form"><label class="sr-only" for="question">向回忆助手提问</label><input id="question" placeholder="问问我们的小宇宙……" maxlength="1000" required /><button type="submit" aria-label="发送问题">↗</button></form><div id="answer" class="answer" hidden aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>
<section class="archive-section wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">KEEP IT CLOSE, KEEP IT FOREVER</p><h3>把我们的故事，带在身边。</h3><p>导出一份离线回忆馆，存进 U 盘。断开网络，也能重新翻开。</p></div><button class="button button-outline local-only" id="export-offline">↓ 导出离线回忆馆</button><span id="offline-badge" hidden>♡ 这份回忆，已陪你离线收藏</span></section>
</main>
<footer class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="#home">our little universe <span>♡</span></a><p>把日子过成诗，把你写进每一行。</p><a href="https://github.com/funnyzak/love-page" rel="noreferrer" class="source-credit">基于 Love Page · AGPL-3.0</a></footer>
<dialog id="story-dialog" class="content-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" data-close aria-label="关闭">×</button><div id="story-content"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="letter-dialog" class="content-dialog letter-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" data-close aria-label="关闭信件">×</button><p class="eyebrow">A LETTER, JUST FOR YOU</p><h2>有些话，想慢慢说。</h2><div id="letter-content" class="prose"></div><p class="letter-sign">一直在你身边的人 ♡</p></dialog>
<dialog id="game-dialog" class="content-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" data-close aria-label="关闭游戏">×</button><p class="eyebrow">OUR MEMORY GAME</p><h2>把我们的瞬间，配成一对。</h2><p id="game-status" class="quiet">找到相同的照片，就像在回忆里再次相遇。</p><div id="game-board"></div><button id="reset-game" class="button button-outline">再玩一次</button></dialog>
<dialog id="studio-dialog" class="studio-dialog"><div class="studio-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY STUDIO</p><h2>慢慢整理，认真收藏。</h2></div><button class="dialog-close" data-close aria-label="关闭整理面板">×</button></div><div class="studio-tabs" role="tablist"><button class="active" data-tab="profile">我们的资料</button><button data-tab="memory">写一篇手记</button><button data-tab="manage">管理与备份</button></div>
<form id="profile-form" class="studio-pane" data-pane="profile"><div class="form-grid"><label>你的昵称<input name="name1" maxlength="30" required /></label><label>另一半的昵称<input name="name2" maxlength="30" required /></label><label>小宇宙的名字<input name="siteName" maxlength="40" required /></label><label>相恋的第一天<input name="startDate" type="date" /></label></div><label>首页寄语<input name="motto" maxlength="150" /></label><label>给对方的一封信<textarea name="letter" rows="7" maxlength="20000"></textarea></label><label>纪念日 <span class="quiet">每行：名称 | YYYY-MM-DD | 每年 或 一次</span><textarea name="anniversaries" rows="3" placeholder="生日 | 2000-05-20 | 每年"></textarea></label><div class="form-footer"><span class="quiet">保存在这台电脑的 Markdown 档案旁。</span><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">保存我们的资料</button></div></form>
<form id="memory-form" class="studio-pane" data-pane="memory" hidden><input type="hidden" name="id" /><input type="hidden" name="revision" /><div class="form-grid"><label>这篇手记的名字<input name="title" maxlength="100" required placeholder="例如：一起等到的第一场雪" /></label><label>发生在哪一天<input name="date" type="date" required /></label></div><label>想记住的事<textarea name="body" rows="7" maxlength="50000" required placeholder="那天发生了什么？最想留下哪个小细节？支持简单 Markdown。"></textarea></label><label>标签<input name="tags" placeholder="旅行，周末，一起做饭" /></label><label class="upload-area">＋ 添加照片、视频或录音<input type="file" id="media-upload" multiple accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,video/mp4,video/webm,audio/mpeg,audio/wav,audio/ogg" /><small>单个文件最多 128 MB；原始文件保存在本机。</small></label><div id="selected-media"></div><div class="form-grid"><label>谁可以看到<select name="visibility"><option value="shared">我们两个人</option><option value="private">仅自己（不展示、不导出）</option></select></label><label>记录状态<select name="status"><option value="confirmed">已确认</option><option value="draft">草稿</option></select></label></div><fieldset><legend>这篇手记可用于</legend><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="publish_online" checked /> 纪念站展示</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="include_in_archive" checked /> 离线回忆馆</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="ai_readable" checked /> 本地助手查阅</label></fieldset><p class="quiet">新上传素材跟随本次范围设置；关联旧素材时保留它原有的权限。</p><div class="form-footer"><button class="text-button" type="button" id="reset-memory">新写一篇</button><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">收藏这段回忆</button></div></form>
<div class="studio-pane" data-pane="manage" hidden><div class="manage-actions"><button id="backup" class="button button-outline">备份全部本地档案</button><button id="clear-demo" class="text-button">收起示例故事</button></div><p class="quiet">示例收起后仍保留历史副本；已写下的真实回忆不受影响。</p><div id="manage-memories"></div><hr /><h3>本地 AI 设置</h3><label>Ollama 模型名称<input id="model-name" value="qwen3:8b" /></label><button id="save-model" class="button button-outline">保存模型设置</button><p id="ai-detail" class="quiet"></p></div><p id="studio-feedback" role="status" class="studio-feedback"></p></dialog>
<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status"></div><script id="universe-data" type="application/json" set:html={payload}></script><script is:inline src="/universe.js"></script>
</body></html>
